    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points Transfer API enables the seamless transfer of loyalty points between members of a hotel loyalty program. This operation allows users to efficiently manage their loyalty points, facilitating enhanced customer engagement and satisfaction. Typically utilized by travel agencies, hotel operators, and loyalty program managers, the API supports use cases such as transferring accrued points as gifts or consolidating points within accounts. The API ensures a smooth user experience by streamlining the points transfer process across different customer accounts.",
